<title>USA: Bristol Hotel says to invest $200 mln.</title>
<headline>Bristol Hotel says to invest $200 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol Hotel Co said Monday it completed its acquisition of 60 full-service company- managed Holiday Inn hotels in the United States and Canada, from Bass Plc.</p>
<p>Bristol also said it will invest in excess of $200 million in capital improvements to the hotels over the next three years.</p>
</text>
